Left BK stump status
Length: 
 Actual length:
 Bony length(From X-ray, 不是斜斜的量，垂直地面的長度才對): 11 cm *(tibia length)
Circumference: 
 5cm from medial tibial plateau: 42 cm
 10cm from medial tibial plateau:  43 cm
Shape: dumbbell
Skin: swelling and erythematous change along suture line
Degree of shrinkage: low


Suggestion:
1.Stump care education: 
 a. Wound care
 b. Desensitization skills by stump massage, tapping or early weight bearing
 c. Promote stump shrinkage：elastic wrap, changed every 4-6 hours (下緊上鬆的綑綁方式促進消腫，加速stump mature)
2.Proper positioning: prevent knee flexion contracture 
 (Pillows not placed under the knee)
3.Initiation of ROM exercise，Muscle Strengthening
4.Early mobilization：standing and balance exercise by walker or crutches
5.Prosthesis application: 請聯絡骨科/整形外科醫師 (已給病人義肢申請書)

Rehabilitation goal:
Short term: Stump shaping (目標stump： 乾淨無傷口，完全消腫，肌力正常，ROM正常)
Long term: Prosthesis training

